id=pixel_skt_mt_fix
name=Pixel SKT incoming-call fix
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=2
author=kyujin
description=Patches com.android.imsstack in memory so incoming VoLTE calls ring with a plain 180 and answer in the 200 OK (SKT drops calls whose 200 OK has no SDP). Finds the patch site from exported symbols, so it is not tied to one firmware build. No system files are changed.
